01021442"}},{"from":{"fname":"daily.journal.2026.05.06","id":"daily.journal.2026.05.06","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":34,"offset":1158},"end":{"line":20,"column":109,"offset":1233},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.agentic-engineering.reference.karpathy-software-is-changing-again"}],"anchors":{"why-this-reference-matters":{"type":"header","text":"Why this reference matters","value":"why-this-reference-matters","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"core-timestamps":{"type":"header","text":"Core timestamps","value":"core-timestamps","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"main-takeaways":{"type":"header","text":"Main takeaways","value":"main-takeaways","line":30,"column":0,"depth":2},"related-notes":{"type":"header","text":"Related notes","value":"related-notes","line":38,"column":0,"depth":2},"references":{"type":"header","text":"References","value":"references","line":43,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"srfyk1hfxp3sm517grxbq6x","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"karpathy--software-is-changing-again\">Karpathy — Software Is Changing (Again)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#karpathy--software-is-changing-again\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"why-this-reference-matters\">Why this reference matters<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#why-this-reference-matters\"></a></h2>\n<p>Talk ini adalah sumber primer untuk argumen agentic engineering yang dipakai dalam zettel: AI boleh generate cepat, tapi manusia tetap harus menjaga loop verifikasi dan autonomy tetap proporsional. Catatan ini khusus merujuk ke YouTube talk dan transcript terkait.</p>\n<h2 id=\"core-timestamps\">Core timestamps<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-timestamps\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>18:29–20:55: partial autonomy, autonomy slider, dan bagaimana memilih level autonomy berdasarkan kompleksitas tugas.</li>\n<li>22:10–23:16: generation-verification loop — AI generate, manusia verify, dan kita harus membuat loop ini cepat.</li>\n<li>22:53–23:35: \"Keep the AI on the leash\" — kenapa diff besar bahaya dan manusia tetap bottleneck.</li>\n<li>23:54–24:13: \"small incremental chunks\" — unit kerja kecil, single concrete thing, dan loop verifikasi yang cepat.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"main-takeaways\">Main takeaways<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#main-takeaways\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Leash = boundary kontrol terhadap AI, agar output tetap bisa diaudit.</li>\n<li>Small incremental chunks = unit kerja kecil dengan scope jelas, verification jelas, dan diff yang bisa diperiksa.</li>\n<li>Generation-verification loop = AI menghasilkan, lalu manusia/sistem memverifikasi sebelum melanjutkan.</li>\n<li>Partial autonomy = autonomy slider, bukan on/off. Autonomy harus disesuaikan dengan risiko task.</li>\n<li>Diff besar bukan kemajuan; itu adalah beban verifikasi.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"related-notes\">Related notes<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#related-notes\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.agentic-engineering.cloud-agent.handson.reference.karpathy-keep-ai-on-the-leash\">Karpathy: Keep AI on the Leash</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1778001021442\">Agentic engineering differs from vibe coding</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"references\">References<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#references\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LCEmiRjPEtQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LCEmiRjPEtQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://singjupost.com/andrej-karpathy-software-is-changing-again/\">https://singjupost.com/andrej-karpathy-software-is-changing-again/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.latent.space/p/s3\">https://www.latent.space/p/s3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://clearthink-ai.com/storyboards/software-is-changing-again/story\">https://clearthink-ai.com/storyboards/software-is-changing-again/story</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://x.com/karpathy/status/1915581920022585597\">https://x.com/karpathy/status/1915581920022585597</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">reference (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">youtube (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">transcript (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">talk (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">x (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">twitter (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/daily.journal.2026.05.06\">2026-05-06</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"ta